# ThePageHeader — Folder Rules

> Pre-edit hook injects the full `RULES.md` chain. Canonical source: `app.vigil/src/components/unique/ThePageHeader/RULES.md`.

## Contract

- `title` is an **i18n key** — resolved with `$t(title)` internally; never pass translated strings
- `icon` is a PrimeIcon class string (e.g. `'pi pi-home'`)
- Hamburger is **`hidden md:flex lg:hidden`** (tablet only) — toggles `uiStore.toggleSidenav()` directly
- `#actions` slot for right-side CTAs — use `v-if="!dialogVisible"` when a dialog is open

## Do not

- Add `@hamburgerClick` emit — store toggle is the contract
- Change hamburger breakpoints without product reason
